<title>USA: Union Pacific Resources Q4 results.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific Resources Q4 results.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.46		 $   0.56</p>
<p> Net			114,300		  139,200</p>
<p> Revs		     566,300		  475,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 250,700		  249,700</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		    $    1.28		    $ n/a</p>
<p> Net			320,800		  350,700</p>
<p> Revs		   1,831,000		1,476,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 250,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Union Pacific Resources Group Inc. Results for 1995 included a $78.5 million gain from the Columbia Gas Transmission Co bankruptcy settlement.</p>
<p>The company carried out an initial public offering in mid-October 1995 and its pro forma average number of shares outstanding for the year was 249.7 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610))</p>
